<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tailoring Boutique Masterclass</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --white: #FFFFFF; --off-white: #FAFAFA; --light-grey: #F3F3F3;
  --soft-grey: #E5E5E5; --border-grey: #979797; --black: #000000;
  --charcoal: #1A1A1A; --dark-text: #111111; --body-text: #2D2D2D;
  --muted: #4A4A4A; --primary-purple: #7F00FF; --light-purple: #B266FF;
  --purple-hover: #5E00CC; --deep-purple: #3D0080;
  --yellow-accent: #FFD600; --yellow-dark: #D4B200;
  --purple-bg: rgba(127,0,255,0.05); --purple-bg2: rgba(127,0,255,0.08);
}
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;overflow-x:hidden;width:100%}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--dark-text);background:var(--white);overflow-x:hidden;width:100%;position:relative;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
button{font-family:inherit}

.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;width:100%}
.section-tag{display:inline-block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary-purple);background:var(--purple-bg2);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:100px;margin-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px}
.section-title{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3.8vw,42px);font-weight:700;color:var(--dark-text);line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.section-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:28px;max-width:580px;font-weight:400}

.cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:15px 30px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:all .25s ease;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.cta-btn--purple{background:var(--primary-purple);color:var(--white);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(127,0,255,.3);animation:glow-p 2.5s infinite}
.cta-btn--purple:hover{background:var(--purple-hover);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(127,0,255,.4)}
@keyframes glow-p{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(127,0,255,.3)}50%{box-shadow:0 4px 32px rgba(127,0,255,.5)}}
.cta-btn--yellow{background:var(--yellow-accent);color:var(--black);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(255,214,0,.35);animation:glow-y 2.5s infinite}
.cta-btn--yellow:hover{background:var(--yellow-dark);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(255,214,0,.45)}
@keyframes glow-y{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(255,214,0,.35)}50%{box-shadow:0 4px 32px rgba(255,214,0,.55)}}
.cta-btn .arrow{display:inline-block;transition:transform .25s}
.cta-btn:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(4px)}
.cta-group{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center}
.cta-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-weight:500}
.cta-note b{color:var(--primary-purple)}
.cta-note--light{color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.cta-note--light b{color:var(--yellow-accent)}

.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .55s ease}
.rv.v{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
.rv-l{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-35px);transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .55s ease}
.rv-l.v{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}
.rv-r{opacity:0;transform:translateX(35px);transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .55s ease}
.rv-r.v{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}

/* HERO */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#080012 0%,#140028 35%,var(--charcoal) 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:100vh;padding:24px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%}
.hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-180px;right:-100px;width:360px;height:360px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(127,0,255,.16) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;max-width:100%}
.hero-particles{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}
.dot{position:absolute;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--primary-purple);border-radius:50%;opacity:.2;animation:dotf 7s ease-in-out infinite}
.dot:nth-child(1){top:12%;left:6%;animation-delay:0s}
.dot:nth-child(2){top:50%;left:88%;animation-delay:1.5s;width:3px;height:3px}
.dot:nth-child(3){top:78%;left:22%;animation-delay:3s;width:6px;height:6px}
.dot:nth-child(4){top:6%;left:62%;animation-delay:.7s}
@keyframes dotf{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.2}50%{transform:translateY(-20px);opacity:.45}}
.hero-grid{
  position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;max-width:100%;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.15fr;
  gap:32px;align-items:center;
}
.hero-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.pre-hl{display:inline-flex;align-self:flex-start;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--yellow-accent);background:rgba(255,214,0,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,214,0,.22);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:100px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.3px;animation:fadeD .5s ease forwards}
@keyframes fadeD{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.hero-h{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3.4vw,38px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.hero-h .ln{display:block;animation:fadeU .6s ease forwards;opacity:0}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.1s}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.4s}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.5s;color:var(--yellow-accent)}
.hero-h .ln:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.6s;color:var(--light-purple);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:.6em;font-weight:500;margin-top:14px;font-style:italic}
@keyframes fadeU{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.hero-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);line-height:1.65;margin:18px 0 0;max-width:480px;animation:fadeU .6s ease .65s forwards;opacity:0;font-weight:400}
.hero-img-mobile{display:none}
.hero-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin:18px 0;animation:fadeU .6s ease .8s forwards;opacity:0}
.hero-cta{animation:fadeU .6s ease .95s forwards;opacity:0}
.hero-right{animation:fadeU .7s ease .35s forwards;opacity:0}
.hero-frame{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-shadow:0 16px 50px rgba(127,0,255,.18);border:2px solid rgba(127,0,255,.2);min-height:500px}
.hero-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;min-height:500px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#140028,#2a0055);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);font-size:13px}

/* MIRROR */
.mirror{padding:56px 0;background:var(--light-grey)}
.mirror-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:24px}
.m-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--soft-grey);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:all .3s ease}
.m-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 32px rgba(127,0,255,.07);border-color:var(--light-purple)}
.m-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:3px;height:100%;background:var(--primary-purple);transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top;transition:transform .3s}
.m-card:hover::before{transform:scaleY(1)}
.m-card-ic{width:40px;height:40px;background:var(--purple-bg2);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px}
.m-card h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark-text);margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.m-card p{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.6}
.m-card p em{color:var(--primary-purple);font-style:italic;font-weight:500}
.mirror-foot{text-align:center;margin-top:28px}
.mirror-foot p{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark-text);margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.mirror-foot p span{color:var(--primary-purple)}

/* TESTIMONIALS */
.testi{padding:56px 0;background:var(--white)}
.testi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:24px}
.testi-row2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;max-width:66.66%;margin:16px auto 0}
.t-card{background:var(--light-grey);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;transition:all .3s ease}
.t-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 32px rgba(127,0,255,.08)}
.t-video{position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;background:#111}
.t-video iframe{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}
.t-info{padding:14px 18px}
.t-stars{color:var(--yellow-accent);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:1px}
.t-name{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:var(--dark-text)}
.t-meta{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;font-weight:500}
.t-result{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary-purple);background:var(--purple-bg2);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px}

/* TRUTH */
.truth{padding:56px 0;background:var(--charcoal);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.truth::before{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-80px;right:-80px;width:360px;height:360px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(127,0,255,.1),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}
.truth .section-tag{background:rgba(255,214,0,.1);color:var(--yellow-accent)}
.truth .section-title{color:var(--white)}
.truth-lead{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--white);margin:12px 0 20px;line-height:1.35;max-width:680px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.truth-lead span{color:var(--yellow-accent);font-style:italic}
.truth-stack{max-width:680px;position:relative;z-index:1}
.tl{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;padding:8px 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);transition:padding-left .25s ease;font-weight:400}
.tl:hover{padding-left:10px}
.tl:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.tl .y{color:var(--yellow-accent);font-weight:600}
.tl em{color:var(--light-purple);font-style:italic;font-weight:500}
.tl strong{color:var(--white);font-weight:600}
.truth-box{margin-top:24px;padding:22px;background:rgba(127,0,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(127,0,255,.18);border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.truth-box-ic{width:44px;height:44px;min-width:44px;background:var(--primary-purple);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.truth-box-txt{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--white);line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.truth-box-txt span{color:var(--yellow-accent);font-style:italic}
.truth-foot{margin-top:24px}

/* LEARN */
.learn{padding:56px 0;background:var(--off-white)}
.learn-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-width:720px;margin-top:20px}
.l-item{display:flex;gap:16px;padding:22px;background:var(--white);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:all .3s ease}
.l-item:hover{border-color:var(--primary-purple);transform:translateX(5px);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(127,0,255,.05)}
.l-num{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary-purple);opacity:.25;line-height:1;min-width:40px}
.l-text h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dark-text);margin-bottom:4px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.l-text p{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.6}
.learn-close{margin-top:22px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:17px;color:var(--body-text);max-width:600px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;font-style:italic}
.learn-foot{margin-top:22px}

/* CTA BAND */
.cta-band{padding:48px 0;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary-purple),var(--deep-purple))}
.cta-band .section-title{color:var(--white);margin-bottom:6px}
.cta-band p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:22px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

/* FILTER */
.filter{padding:56px 0;background:var(--white)}
.f-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:24px}
.f-col{background:var(--light-grey);border-radius:12px;padding:26px}
.f-col h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.f-col.yes h3{color:#16a34a}
.f-col.no h3{color:#dc2626}
.f-list{list-style:none}
.f-list li{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--soft-grey);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;line-height:1.55}
.f-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.f-ic{font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
.filter-foot{text-align:center;margin-top:22px}
.filter-note{margin-top:16px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;text-align:center}

/* FAQ */
.faq{padding:56px 0;background:var(--off-white)}
.faq-list{max-width:700px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}
.faq-item{border:1px solid var(--soft-grey);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--white);transition:border-color .25s}
.faq-item:hover{border-color:var(--primary-purple)}
.faq-q{width:100%;background:none;border:none;padding:18px 22px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark-text);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.faq-q .ic{font-size:20px;color:var(--primary-purple);transition:transform .25s;flex-shrink:0}
.faq-item.open .faq-q .ic{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .35s ease}
.faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:260px}
.faq-a-inner{padding:0 22px 18px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--body-text);line-height:1.65}

/* FINAL */
.final{padding:64px 0;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--black),#140028,var(--charcoal))}
.final::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;width:440px;height:440px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(127,0,255,.1),transparent 70%);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);pointer-events:none}
.final-h{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3.6vw,36px);font-weight:700;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.25;position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:800px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.final-h span{color:var(--yellow-accent);font-style:italic}
.final-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin-bottom:26px;position:relative;z-index:1}

/* STICKY */
.sticky{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:var(--white);border-top:2px solid var(--soft-grey);padding:8px 16px;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;z-index:9999;box-shadow:0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.sticky-txt{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--dark-text);font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}
.sticky-txt small{display:block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.sticky .cta-btn{padding:10px 18px;font-size:13px;animation:none;white-space:nowrap}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero{padding:20px 0;min-height:100vh}
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;text-align:center;width:100%}
  .pre-hl{align-self:center}
  .hero-sub{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
  .hero-img-mobile{display:block;margin:18px 0;width:100%}
  .hero-img-mobile .hero-frame{min-height:auto;height:auto;border-radius:12px;aspect-ratio:16/10}
  .hero-img-mobile .hero-placeholder{min-height:auto;height:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10}
  .hero-right{display:none}
  .hero-meta{justify-content:center;margin-top:18px}
  .hero-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .hero-cta .cta-group{justify-content:center}
  .mirror-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .testi-row2{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:100%}
  .f-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tl{font-size:15px}
  .truth-lead{font-size:19px}
  .truth-box{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}
  .sticky{display:flex}
  body{padding-bottom:60px}
  .mirror,.testi,.truth,.learn,.filter,.faq{padding:44px 0}
  .cta-band{padding:40px 0}
  .final{padding:52px 0}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .hero{padding:16px 0}
  .hero-h{font-size:22px;line-height:1.25}
  .hero-h .ln:nth-child(6){font-size:.68em;margin-top:10px}
  .hero-sub{font-size:14px}
  .cta-btn{width:100%;font-size:14px;padding:13px 18px}
  .section-title{font-size:22px}
  .m-card{padding:18px}
  .m-card h3{font-size:17px}
  .tl{font-size:14px}
  .truth-lead{font-size:17px}
  .truth-box-txt{font-size:16px}
  .l-item{padding:16px}
  .l-text h3{font-size:16px}
  .final-h{font-size:20px}
  .hero-img-mobile{max-width:100%}
  .hero-img-mobile .hero-frame{aspect-ratio:4/3}
  .hero-img-mobile .hero-placeholder{aspect-ratio:4/3}
  .container{padding:0 18px}
  .mirror,.testi,.truth,.learn,.filter,.faq{padding:36px 0}
  .cta-band{padding:36px 0}
  .final{padding:44px 0}
  .faq-q{font-size:15px;padding:16px 18px}
  .faq-a-inner{padding:0 18px 16px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- SECTION 1: HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-particles">
    <div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div><div class="dot"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <div class="pre-hl">For tailoring boutique owners who read this and immediately felt something</div>
        <h1 class="hero-h">
          <span class="ln">You're stuck.</span>
          <span class="ln">Not because you're lazy.</span>
          <span class="ln">Not because you're unlucky.</span>
          <span class="ln">Not because your city is small.</span>
          <span class="ln">Your boutique was built to need you for everything.</span>
          <span class="ln">In 3 hours, I'll show you how to un-build that.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">The exact system tailoring boutique owners are using to hand over measurements, fittings, and deliveries — and still have their name on the door.</p>

        <div class="hero-img-mobile">
          <div class="hero-frame">
            <div class="hero-placeholder">
              <svg width="36" height="36" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.3)" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Replace with image or video</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span>📅 January 25, 2025</span>
          <span>⏰ 11:00 AM IST</span>
          <span>💻 Live on Zoom</span>
          <span>💰 Just ₹199</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-cta">
          <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="#register" class="cta-btn cta-btn--yellow">Yes, Free Me From This — ₹199 <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          </div>
          <p class="cta-note cta-note--light"><b>243</b> tailoring boutique owners registered · Live seats filling fast</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-right">
